  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Cook the Penne pasta according to package instructions until al dente. Drain and set aside.",
    "Season the smoked chicken breast with salt, black pepper, and chili flakes.",
    "Grill or roast the chicken breast in the oven for 15-20 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "In a large skillet, heat 2 tbsp of oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and sauté for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the Hunan sauce, citrus juice, soy sauce, and sugar. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the sauce to a simmer and cook for 2-3 minutes until it thickens.",
    "Add the cooked Penne pasta to the sauce and toss to coat.",
    "Slice the grilled chicken breast into thin strips and add to the pasta.",
    "Top with chopped green onions and season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
